sequenceDiagram
    participant C as client.py, one ThreadedClient
    participant M as multiplexer
    participant A as worker alpha
    C->>M: INFER_REQUEST, a query
    M->>A: INFER_REQUEST, to ANY worker of type INFERENCE, round robin
    Note over A: the model reads the digit
    A->>M: INFER_RESPONSE, references the request's id
    M->>C: INFER_RESPONSE, and query() returns it
